{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Python 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Python 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n<your_rewritten_code_5>\nn, m = map(int, input().split())\na = list(map(int, input().split()))\n\n# Compute all subset sums for left and right halves\ndef compute_sums(arr, mod):\n    res = []\n    total = len(arr)\n    for mask in range(1 << total):\n        s = 0\n        for i in range(total):\n            if mask & (1 << i):\n                s += arr[i]\n        res.append(s % mod)\n    return res\n\nmid = n // 2\nleft_mod_sums = compute_sums(a[:mid], m)\nright_mod_sums = compute_sums(a[mid:], m)\n\n# Deduplicate and sort left sums\nleft_mod_sums = sorted(set(left_mod_sums))\n\n# Search for best combination\nbest_sum = 0\nfrom bisect import bisect_left\n\nfor r_val in right_mod_sums:\n    needed = m - r_val\n    idx = bisect_left(left_mod_sums, needed)\n    if idx > 0:\n        cur = left_mod_sums[idx-1] + r_val\n        if cur > best_sum:\n            best_sum = cur\n\nprint(best_sum)\n</your_rewritten_code_5>\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        String[] firstLine = br.readLine().split(\" \");\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(firstLine[0]);\n        int m = Integer.parseInt(firstLine[1]);\n        \n        String[] secondLine = br.readLine().split(\" \");\n        int[] a = new int[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            a[i] = Integer.parseInt(secondLine[i]);\n        }\n        \n        int mid = n / 2;\n        List<Integer> leftModSums = computeSums(Arrays.copyOfRange(a, 0, mid), m);\n        List<Integer> rightModSums = computeSums(Arrays.copyOfRange(a, mid, n), m);\n        \n        // Deduplicate and sort left sums\n        Set<Integer> leftSet = new HashSet<>(leftModSums);\n        List<Integer> leftModSumsSorted = new ArrayList<>(leftSet);\n        Collections.sort(leftModSumsSorted);\n        \n        // Search for best combination\n        int bestSum = 0;\n        \n        for (int rVal : rightModSums) {\n            int needed = m - rVal;\n            int idx = binarySearch(leftModSumsSorted, needed);\n            if (idx > 0) {\n                int cur = leftModSumsSorted.get(idx - 1) + rVal;\n                if (cur > bestSum) {\n                    bestSum = cur;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(bestSum);\n    }\n    \n    private static List<Integer> computeSums(int[] arr, int mod) {\n        List<Integer> res = new ArrayList<>();\n        int total = arr.length;\n        for (int mask = 0; mask < (1 << total); mask++) {\n            int s = 0;\n            for (int i = 0; i < total; i++) {\n                if ((mask & (1 << i)) != 0) {\n                    s += arr[i];\n                }\n            }\n            res.add(s % mod);\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n    \n    private static int binarySearch(List<Integer> list, int target) {\n        int left = 0;\n        int right = list.size();\n        while (left < right) {\n            int mid = (left + right) / 2;\n            if (list.get(mid) >= target) {\n                right = mid;\n            } else {\n                left = mid + 1;\n            }\n        }\n        return left;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0001248043408850208, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -5.304672595229931e-05, -1.4662635294371285e-05, -0.006718072574585676, -0.5767124891281128, -0.020615823566913605, -1.1444026313256472e-05, -0.00012861855793744326, -0.00029130507027730346, -1.3232143828645349e-05, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -0.0003077510336879641, -1.680836794548668e-05, -4.291525328881107e-06, -0.0007669368060305715, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.0007415643776766956, -1.4424220353248529e-05, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.311301275563892e-06, -1.966933996300213e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.0015325717395171523, -0.001955384388566017, -2.50339189733495e-06, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -8.606540359323844e-05, -7.83174327807501e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, -4.410734163684538e-06, -3.933898824470816e-06, -1.811964830267243e-05, -1.823885577323381e-05, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -3.1470757676288486e-05, -4.768360213347478e-06, -0.0030272630974650383, -5.245195097813848e-06, -0.47044336795806885, -3.302042750874534e-05, 0.0, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -9.65590606938349e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -6.532455881824717e-05, -0.00026353701832704246, -3.1709168979432434e-05, -1.3947389561508317e-05, -2.0265558760002023e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -2.169585604860913e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.3470558769768104e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.7881377516459906e-06, 0.0, -5.245195097813848e-06, -5.245195097813848e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -1.1920858014